# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-JQ8AV`.
#
# One test, both halves of the acceptance: a NETWORK-WAITING stub (ESTABLISHED
# against a local listener, ~0% cpu, the incident statusline on its pane)
# must survive three compressed stall windows, and the same run with an
# at-rest pane over a sleeping, connectionless process must die on schedule.
#
# Requires a usable `rmux` (the test is declared in this binary's
# `required_test_tooling_is_present` sentinel). On a host without it the test
# skips and the red phase fails loudly against this pin instead of passing
# silently.
#
# `env -u ...` because a dispatch leaks its run id and home into subprocesses,
# and this test builds and drives a supervisor that must see neither.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-daemon --lib -- a_network_waiting_provider_turn_survives_the_stall_window_and_a_wedge_dies
